1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:16,800
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:25,640
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:36,080
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:44,720
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:51,080
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:55,440
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,400
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,400
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,600
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,240
Chase !

11
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,440
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,360
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,400
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:27,240
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:29,600
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,040
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,680
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,240
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:47,560
What is there to fear ?

20
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:57,200
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

21
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,510
Now,

22
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,000
take me to the Mysterious Yin Cauldron.

23
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:10,630
Naturally...

24
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:11,550
Naturally...

25
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,030
Ta Shan,

26
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,510
Upper Celestial has already shown you mercy.

27
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,550
Don't be so ungrateful.

28
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,350
Grandpa,

29
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:27,430
no one knows the Mysterious Yin Cauldron's location better than me.

30
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:28,910
You're getting old.

31
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,550
As the altar's guardian,

32
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,910
it's my duty to lead the way.

33
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,080
The name "Chosen Immortal Clan"

34
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,390
is because we were chosen by Celestials

35
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,630
and blessed by their grace.

36
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,360
We must guard this place

37
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:45,110
and protect the Mysterious Yin Cauldron until the Celestials return.

38
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,110
This is the mission the Celestials gave us.

39
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,160
Every member of the Chosen Immortal Clan

40
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,390
should take pride in this.

41
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,870
Is that a Celestial ?

42
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,590
Move a little bit,

43
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,870
I want to see too.

44
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,440
When I was their age,

45
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,880
I believed those stories too.

46
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:05,440
Altar
Chosen Immortal Clan

47
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,070
So I cultivated day and night,

48
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,710
I never dared to slack off,

49
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,200
and I became my generation's guardian of the altar.

50
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,550
Chosen Immortal Clan...

51
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:16,630
Forsaken Immortal Clan...

52
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,070
Their name is almost the same.

53
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,200
What's the link between them ?

54
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,640
The Mysterious Yin Cauldron is at the bottom of the cave.

55
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,430
Senior,

56
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,550
please.

57
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,480
Do you have something to ask ?

58
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,630
Senior,

59
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:48,560
are you...

60
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,550
really a Celestial ?

61
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,150
I'm not.

62
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:54,910
I knew it...

63
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,150
If you suspected me,

64
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,070
why did you bring me in here ?

65
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,790
The person who saved our clan

66
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,870
was you,

67
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,110
not that non-existent Celestial.

68
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,680
Although the Celestial Realm has collapsed,

69
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,230
some Celestials might have survived.

70
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,160
Even if some did,

71
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,590
I'm afraid they abandoned us long ago.

72
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,710
What "chosen by Celestials"

73
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,870
and "blessed by their grace"...

74
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,640
Senior, do you know why

75
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,470
this place is overrun with fog beasts ?

76
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,470
The Clan Head certainly never told you.

77
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,790
These fog beasts

78
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,470
originated from the Mysterious Yin Cauldron itself !

79
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:34,280
Mysterious Yin Cauldron

80
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,310
That's right.

81
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,870
Ironic, isn't it ?

82
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,990
What our clan protects

83
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:41,400
is precisely the source of the fog beasts slaughtering our people.

84
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,430
A single word from a Celestial

85
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,520
made us protect it for 30 000 years !

86
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,910
And the result ?

87
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,310
How many of our members

88
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,550
haven't lost one of their limbs ?

89
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,950
Grandpa always talks of loyalty and righteousness,

90
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,750
but are loyalty and righteousness

91
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,110
worth the lives of the entire clan !?

92
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:03,830
Senior,

93
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,510
Ta Shan has a request.

94
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,230
Now that the clan

95
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,150
sees Senior as a Celestial,

96
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,670
no one will disobey

97
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,790
whatever you say.

98
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,590
Junior begs Senior

99
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,030
to lead us away from this place

100
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,630
by using your identity as a Celestial.

101
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,710
If you agree,

102
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,510
Ta Shan will serve you for life,

103
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,990
without regard for life or death.

104
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,190
I was also accidentally transported here

105
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,110
and I don't know where the exit is.

106
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,870
Even Senior doesn't know...

107
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,830
I led exploration teams several times.

108
00:05:35,290 --> 00:05:36,550
Following the rifts

109
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,270
only led to another dead zone.

110
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,670
This place is surrounded in fleshy walls

111
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,630
and has no sky.

112
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:43,550
Even if we force our way through,

113
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,390
there is only endless void.

114
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,870
Surronded in fleshy walls...

115
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,590
Endless void outside...

116
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:54,510
The Celestial Realm has always had a tradition of capturing beasts,

117
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:56,270
they specialized in rare beasts.

118
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,830
This beast

119
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,670
hides in dark, mysterious places.

120
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:02,110
Its belly can contain a world.

121
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,870
Its name is

122
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,790
the Nether Beast.

123
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,520
This beast's body forms its own formation of restrictions

124
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,830
with netherworld fog as its source.

125
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,270
Where the fog rises

126
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,670
is the formation's eye.

127
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,030
To leave this formation,

128
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,870
the formation's eye must be broken.

129
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,910
What is that ?

130
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:44,480
Cauldron Spirit
Mysterious Yin Cauldron

131
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,550
This sound attacks the Origin Soul directly.

132
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,400
Teleport...

133
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,360
A teleportation formation !

134
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,430
The exit is hidden beneath the cauldron !

135
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,030
Upper Celestial !

136
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:00,750
Ta Shan,

137
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,870
what did you do !?

138
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,750
How did you provoke the Cauldron Spirit's wrath ?

139
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:04,990
Cauldron Spirit ?

140
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:05,870
Grandpa,

141
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,440
there's a teleportation formation beneath the cauldron.

142
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,750
We just saw it with our own eyes !

143
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,910
Wh...What  ?

144
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:11,510
Impossible.

145
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,910
None of our ancestors ever mentioned it.

146
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,950
But we really saw it !

147
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,590
That must be the exit !

148
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,230
Exit ?

149
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,590
The exit to leave this place !?

150
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,710
Silence !

151
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,830
Our clan was ordered to protect this cauldron.

152
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,040
How dare you harbor thoughts of deserting our duty ?

153
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,280
While the cauldron stands,

154
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,710
our clan also stands.

155
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,270
Grandpa !

156
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,470
Being forced to kneel for so long

157
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:34,840
made him servile.

158
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,080
Even if the others wish to help,

159
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,270
if he isn't willing,

160
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,640
it will all be in vain.

161
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,720
You may withdraw,

162
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,120
I will enter seclusion here.

163
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:43,950
Understood.

164
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,030
This place

165
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,430
shall become a forbidden area.

166
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,310
No one will be allowed to disturb Upper Celestial.

167
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,910
I can't stay here long.

168
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,750
The spell that Cauldron Spirit used attacks the Origin Soul.

169
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,470
It seems I need to find a way to protect my Origin Soul

170
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,150
before going back in.

171
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,600
I gained quite a lot from the Thunder Celestial Realm.

172
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:05,560
There might be

173
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,470
a solution among the loot.

174
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,910
I need to refine an artifact here

175
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:12,790
so the three of you will guard me.

176
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,350
100 zhang in all directions,

177
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,310
don't let anyone step in.

178
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,150
Master can rest assured.

179
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,710
Little Xu will protect you to the death.

180
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,230
Whoever comes to disturb your cultivation

181
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,310
will have to first step upon my corpse.

182
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:25,750
I, Xu Liguo, live a life of loyalty and righteousness !

183
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,030
You two,

184
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,110
come with me.

185
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,390
To guard Master,

186
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,550
you must stand your ground.

187
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,390
Just because I stopped flattering him a bit,

188
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,190
and I've already fallen out of favor.

189
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,230
It seems I still need more practice !

190
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,070
I, Xu Liguo,

191
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:48,550
was born to live a life of loyalty

192
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,790
and to fight for righteousness !

193
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,550
This heart, this body,

194
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,670
the heavens and the earth can bear witness !

195
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,190
The Collection Pavilion

196
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,470
was my greatest harvest from the Thunder Celestial Realm.

197
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,230
A nine-story pagoda...

198
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,190
How many celestial spells does it contain ?

199
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,880
Unfortunately, the restrictions are hard to break.

200
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,230
I must leave it for later.

201
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,280
This item is extraordinary,

202
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,950
I'll hide it like this

203
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,390
just to be safe.

204
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,950
The Ancient God Leather Armor...

205
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,080
Maybe I can attach it to my Origin Soul.

206
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,350
Like this,

207
00:10:58,080 --> 00:11:00,190
that Cauldron Spirit can no longer harm me.

208
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,430
This talisman is no ordinary item.

209
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,590
Perhaps I can ask that person from the Thunder Celestial Temple.

210
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,430
What is this ?

211
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,110
This...

212
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:13,990
This is...

213
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:18,920
Fellow cultivator...

214
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:19,990
Senior ! Spare my life !

215
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,150
I have treasures,

216
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,270
I'll give them all to you !

217
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:24,110
You're just an Origin Soul.

218
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,750
How could you have treasures ?

219
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,480
I...

220
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,040
I have some !

221
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,910
You took my bag of holding

222
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,590
but there's a hidden compartment inside

223
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,550
with a restriction !

224
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,990
I'm the only one that can open it !

225
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,070
A defensive artifact ?

226
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,120
It's usable.

227
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,870
What else ?

228
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,600
There's more...

229
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,070
There's more !

230
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:04,070
My golden lock !

231
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,390
An ordinary item

232
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,150
isn't enough to buy your life.

233
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:08,790
No...

234
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,430
No !

235
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,350
I still have some !

236
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:11,150
I...

237
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:11,950
Right,

238
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,270
an Allheaven Stone !

239
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,510
I know you can obtain an Allheaven Stone !

240
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,510
If you spare me,

241
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,910
I'll lead you there !

242
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,790
An Allheaven Stone...

243
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,150
A rune ?

244
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,710
I wonder what effect it has.

245
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:47,680
Mosquito Beast,

246
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,160
come.

247
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,310
A sealing effect ?

248
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,590
This is the true valuable part of his artifact.

249
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,270
The messenger that carried the golden lock

250
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,390
truly wasted its potential.

251
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,430
If I could take this rune

252
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,750
and draw a lot of it on an artifact...

253
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,950
In that case,

254
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,790
I shall use this sealing rune

255
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:35,190
to bestow my stamp with a spell !

256
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:55,520
8 days later

257
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,390
This stamp

258
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:08,800
shall be named the Celestial Sealing Stamp.

259
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,230
With this stamp,

260
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,510
I'll be able to deal with the Cauldron Spirit.

261
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,160
The Celestials ordered them to guard the cauldron,

262
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,990
but allowed the fog beasts to slaughter them.

263
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:21,510
All of this

264
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:24,070
feels like a part of a bigger scheme.

265
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,310
If there really is a Celestial manipulating everything behind the scenes,

266
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,230
no matter what he wants to do,

267
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,030
I'll need enough power

268
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,950
to break out of here.

269
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:35,350
If he's still there,

270
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:36,840
I might have to fight.

271
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,590
I need one thing

272
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,590
to slay a Celestial.

273
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,270
At Early stage Soul Formation,

274
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:49,150
by wielding the first God Slaying Chariot,

275
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,590
I could kill Late stage Soul Formation cultivators.

276
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:53,990
At Soul Transformation,

277
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,790
with the might of the second God Slaying Chariot,

278
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,870
I could challenge Early stage Ascendant cultivators.

279
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,240
At Ascendant,

280
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:02,390
by releasing seals of the second God Slaying Chariot,

281
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:05,030
I was able to fight Illusory Yin cultivators.

282
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,760
I wonder what this third God Slaying Chariot

283
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,670
has in store for me.

